@ParkDesk.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5096

### Login as the seeded admin
POST {{ParkDesk.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@parkdesk.local",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

### List parking lots (public)
GET {{ParkDesk.Api_HostAddress}}/api/lots
Accept: application/json

### Check in a walk-in vehicle (requires an Admin/Operator bearer token)
# @name checkin
POST {{ParkDesk.Api_HostAddress}}/api/lots/{{lotId}}/sessions/checkin
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "plate": "ABC123",
  "vehicleType": "Car"
}

###
